@startuml
title 企业文件管理系统 - 文件夹管理时序图

actor 用户 as User
participant "浏览器/文件夹页\n(folders/List.vue)" as UI
participant "Axios\nrequest.js" as Axios
participant "文件夹控制器\nFolderController" as FolderCtrl
participant "文件夹服务\nFolderService" as FolderSvc
database "FolderRepository\n(MySQL)" as DB

== 创建 ==
User -> UI: 输入名称/选择父文件夹
UI -> Axios: POST /api/folders/create\n{ name, parentId? }
Axios -> FolderCtrl: createFolder(body)
FolderCtrl -> SecurityContext: 获取 userId
FolderCtrl -> FolderSvc: createFolder(name, parentId, userId)
FolderSvc -> DB: 检查重名 & 父级存在性
FolderSvc -> DB: 保存
FolderCtrl --> Axios: 200 { folderId, name, parentId, createTime }

== 列表 ==
UI -> Axios: GET /api/folders/list[?parentId]
Axios -> FolderCtrl: getUserFolders(parentId)
FolderCtrl -> SecurityContext: 获取 userId
FolderCtrl -> FolderSvc: getUserFolders(userId, parentId)
alt 根目录
  FolderSvc -> DB: findByUserIdAndParentIsNullAndDeletedFalseOrderByCreateTimeDesc
else 指定父级
  FolderSvc -> DB: findByUserIdAndParentIdAndDeletedFalseOrderByCreateTimeDesc
end
FolderCtrl --> Axios: 200 [Folder...]

== 删除 ==
UI -> Axios: DELETE /api/folders/{folderId}
Axios -> FolderCtrl: deleteFolder(folderId)
FolderCtrl -> SecurityContext: 获取 userId
FolderCtrl -> FolderSvc: deleteFolder(folderId, userId)
FolderSvc -> DB: 标记 deleted=true, deleteTime=now
FolderCtrl --> Axios: 200 { message }

== 重命名 ==
UI -> Axios: PUT /api/folders/{folderId}/rename\n{ name }
Axios -> FolderCtrl: renameFolder(folderId, body)
FolderCtrl -> SecurityContext: 获取 userId
FolderCtrl -> FolderSvc: renameFolder(folderId, userId, name)
FolderSvc -> DB: 检查同级重名并保存
FolderCtrl --> Axios: 200 { folderId, name }

== 移动 ==
UI -> Axios: POST /api/folders/{folderId}/move\n{ targetParentId }
Axios -> FolderCtrl: moveFolder(folderId, body)
FolderCtrl -> SecurityContext: 获取 userId
FolderCtrl -> FolderSvc: moveFolder(folderId, userId, targetParentId)
FolderSvc -> DB: 检查目标父级/循环关系并保存
FolderCtrl --> Axios: 200 { folderId, parentId }

== 获取路径 ==
UI -> Axios: GET /api/folders/{folderId}/path
Axios -> FolderCtrl: getFolderPath(folderId)
FolderCtrl -> SecurityContext: 获取 userId
FolderCtrl -> FolderSvc: getFolderPath(folderId, userId)
FolderSvc -> DB: 查询路径（简化版返回自身）
FolderCtrl --> Axios: 200 [Folder...]

@enduml

